killId` with `kind: 'skill'`, and drop it when that skill is already in the list. Verify: `$TC` exits 0.\n\n  Line 104: - [ ] T022 [P] Create `$ADV/tests/cli-degraded-command-contract.vitest.ts`. It calls the exported `degradedRecommendations` with a typed prompt `/speckit:save this session` over a `command-speckit-save` entry and expects `command` `/speckit:save` and `policy` `start`, then with `create a readme for the utils folder` over `sk-doc` and `command-create-readme` entries and expects one `sk-doc` entry with no `command`. Verify: in `ADV`, `npx vitest run tests/cli-degraded-command-contract.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w3-T016.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794527166699,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd8caa8ffeZ67pYaAASeaXH6\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d2277eb8001SGSz53zGF3nUYp\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd8caa8ffeZ67pYaAASeaXH6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d22774e80013V8R3OyW0rNjDt\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_9b32838b5e804832aef1eee9\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md, lines 1-284\\n1: ---\\n2: title: \\\"Tasks: Phase 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\\"\\n3: description: \\\"Ordered worker-sized tasks that generate one command table, fill four recommendation fields, print the command and its policy in the brief, state the degraded contract, fix the reach check and retire the legacy ids.\