m-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md:\n  Line 96: - [ ] T018 In `CLI`, pass the prompt to `degradedRecommendations` and export it. For an entry with a `commandRowFor(entry.skill)` row: when the prompt contains the row's bare slash command (the text before the first space), emit `skillId`, `kind: 'command'`, `command`, `policy` and `ownerSkillId`. Otherwise emit the row's `ownerSkillId` as `skillId` with `kind: 'skill'`, and drop it when that skill is already in the list. Verify: `$TC` exits 0.\n\n  Line 104: - [ ] T022 [P] Create `$ADV/tests/cli-degraded-command-contract.vitest.ts`. It calls the exported `degradedRecommendations` with a typed prompt `/speckit:save this session` over a `command-speckit-save` entry and expects `command` `/speckit:save` and `policy` `start`, then with `create a readme for the utils folder` over `sk-doc` and `command-create-readme` entries and expects one `sk-doc` entry with no `command`. Verify: in `ADV`, `npx vitest run tests/cli-degraded-command-contract.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w3-T016.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794527166699,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd8caa8ffeZ67pYaAASeaXH6\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d2277eb8001SGSz53zGF3nUYp\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd8caa8ffeZ67pYaAASeaXH6\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d22774e80013V8R3OyW0rNjDt\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_9b32838b5e804832aef1eee9\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md\"},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-sur