{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527473058,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd8cae6ffeV3iKQc8fxV7h6K","part":{"id":"prt_1d22c2540002Voi7AYVr66BYsW","sessionID":"ses_e2dd8cae6ffeV3iKQc8fxV7h6K","messageID":"msg_1d22c1210001lccVYoQE2O8ZJo","type":"text","text":"T018 is implemented in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts`, and the task's verify command exits 0.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Imported `commandRowFor` from `./lib/command-attach.js`.\n- Exported `degradedRecommendations(entries, prompt)`. A command row is kept with `kind: 'command'`, `command`, `policy` and `ownerSkillId` when the prompt contains its bare slash command. Otherwise it collapses to `ownerSkillId` with `kind: 'skill'`, and is dropped when that skill is already in the output list.\n- Passed the prompt from `invokeAdvisorRecommendPayload` at the one call site.\n\nVerify, run in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`:\n\n```text\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n```\n\nExit status 0, no compiler output. Only the named file was edited, the checkbox was not ticked, and nothing was committed. Runtime behavior was not exercised because T018 names only the typecheck gate. Nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794527470912,"end":1794527473058}}}
